<https://loze-ontology.org/hasContent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a particular p if and only if p is the content in e" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isSettingIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is Setting In" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isDeterminationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a schematic particular x and another schematic particular y if and only if x has all the essential properties of y together with further essential properties that y lacks" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasContent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
