<https://loze-ontology.org/isAgentIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The killer is the agent in a killing, the mechanic is the agent in the repair of the car, Joe is the agent in Joe's walking, the baker is the agent in the making of the bread" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a schematic particular x and a schematic particular y if and only if y is a determination of x" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasIngredient> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a composition c and a substance s if and only if s is the ingredient in c" .
