<https://loze-ontology.org/hasConcretization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a schematic particular s and a concrete particular c if and only if c is a concretization of s" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/Place> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The matter that is hosted in a place makes no difference for the individuation of that place: a room remains in existence irrespective of whether it hosts an absolute vacuum, a few pieces of furniture and regular air, or a giant load of cotton wool" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isDestinationIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between a particular p and an eventuality e if and only if p is the terminal point of movement or change in the context of e" .
