<https://loze-ontology.org/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A group does not need to be legally registered or recognised to qualify as an organisation; in fact, there are organisations that are inherently illegal, such as criminal gangs and terrorist organisations" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isHeldIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between an entity e and an eventuality e' if and only if e is controlled by or subordinated to some other entity in the context of e' " .
