<https://loze-ontology.org/isContentIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The liquid is the content in its containment by a tank, the fluid is the content when flowing in a duct" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/fromTime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
