<https://loze-ontology.org/isInstrumentIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The instrument in an eventuality can also be a person: for example, the messenger is the instrument in the sending of a message" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/InformationArtefact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A book, an article, a note, a document, a digital file, a computer programme or software" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isWaypointIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The destination does not need to be a place, but it can be a thing or a period of time too" .
