<https://loze-ontology.org/isInstrumentIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://loze-ontology.org/isParticipantIn> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isReferencePointIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "In ordinary talk, the reference point of a movement is often not mentioned because it's identified by default with the Earth - or some Earth-based reference framework" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isDestinationIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is Destination In" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isCompositeIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
