_:n79c81c57dfd0483097f8dc132c74bab9b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://loze-ontology.org/NonHumanAnimal> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/Group> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A household, a family, a couple, any organisation" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasTheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that obtains between an eventuality e and a particular p if and only if p is a theme in e" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isTopicIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Since a cognition can be about abstractions, the topic of an eventuality can also be a class or a schematic particular" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/Particular> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointUnionOf> _:n063a40871ee841d298f54ea38223eb81b3 .
