<https://loze-ontology.org/InformationArtefact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "An information artefact that is concrete is always going to be the concretization of some schematic information artefact" .
<https://loze-ontology.org/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/isParticipantIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "There are various ways in which an entity can participate in an eventuality, which are expressed by means of various sub-relations of loze:isParticipantIn" .
